			(property "Imax_basis" "PN532/C1 data sheet Rev. 3.6, Table 290 limiting values: VBAT -0.5 to 6.0 V, PVDD (host interface) -0.5 to 4 V, ITVDD 150 mA (antenna driver), ISVDD 30 mA, Ptot 500 mW. Operating VBAT 2.7 to 5.5 V; IVBAT 150 mA max in continuous wave, below 100 mA with a tuned antenna. The module's path from VCC to VBAT and PVDD is UNCONFIRMED; fed from 3V3, VCC is under both limits"
				(at 0 0 0)
				(show_name no)
				(do_not_autoplace no)
