	(text "Bench reader. Firmware: reader/src/main.cpp (filament-kit).\nPower: the C3's USB 5 V; every module on the C3's 3V3 pin.\nI2C: PN532 (0x24, mode switches set to I2C) and OLED (0x3C) share SDA/SCL.\nPN532 IRQ and RSTO stay unconnected (firmware polls over I2C).\nEncoder: A/B to GPIO 3/4 with internal pull-ups, common C to GND;\npush switch S1-S2 between GPIO 1 and 3V3, internal pull-down.\nBuzzer module is active-low: firmware idles GPIO 0 high.\nUNCONFIRMED: PN532 and encoder module pin orders, PN532 supply pin, encoder type."
